 "id": "1306077874068011", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831382_1306077877401344_1765258583663581157_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SifLaaLbiCoQ7kNvwF41S6X&_nc_oc=AdrXK76xiUasDIdd7rV2FiKbvn-40p2FYx-QAAmDVrbbHKVDALGXaG2EBM3-bKFjcG0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6xKC2Z_MvjAIxWfpid_vpSGFBAdfrUd-RFpwfQGSY-sw&oe=6A1713E9"}, {"file_name": "SEG_bigger_than_you.png", "id": "1206080324902796", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828806_1206080328236129_2742122223349957529_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W30joRoLgL4Q7kNvwFp523m&_nc_oc=AdoM_OSS42onvCt8FkT-S5WElplWg8CUb-DMvC0HsOJHO3GKxbH6NhQNNjuMNeZTkhs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af74SJdELR20hLI2PoKd1aFq-NxMqbFUOAw7i04oO0vRUg&oe=6A16DDD7"}, {"file_name": "SEG_play_with_your_food.png", "id": "688276044317723", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831056_688276047651056_3567363028985136938_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vtjCfn-pwhcQ7kNvwFqYRhm&_nc_oc=AdoUjTzmZuaNEsp6y0JOUiK12hYyFIgLLhg1sTwRiF8bEybjxXL9IDJm4Hu167O_7wE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5H73mcnopjo6Xf1iE1yw41d2P6xvHXBFnvftJdsEzV9A&oe=6A16E483"}, {"file_name": "SEG_smash_it.png", "id": "636852536030504", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823757_636852539363837_1102269768077396377_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=q45tdNxKg6MQ7kNvwF3Jko5&_nc_oc=Adrs7AL9QYpGKpv_o3d0tQkIdd7jLv7PCzvbH3sJeVldlHCZ6NlqOdVUU_fSUg99Mgw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5Cu5Jc_fXdfAOSVfGRsKJmvg7XENfj-j5vnxuGp6xZ7g&oe=6A1713C5"}, {"file_name": "SEG_all_star_smash.png", "id": "657260543892494", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821674_657260547225827_15667374464005964_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ztMSiSu56q0Q7kNvwG1Mest&_nc_oc=AdqIAi2EW7Dmp4TyGnzEsMyw3KvGcf2aiyIdIN73IA1WoAGkyXh4D3ay3Q-VP8HYz48&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7X70_3mzIx2nJ2Hvdv4rw98se8E9MrklhLv0zgV2BgCA&oe=6A170236"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "SEG_Cover_Landscape.png", "id": "778139748375025", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_778139751708358_1423033100072686582_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JfI6BKZbNmMQ7kNvwEuc1QA&_nc_oc=Adrh0Rcq5VGl57u-cdI5ctVuQfIN3sJNALOLKbmJVOFHsh_xVe7d0Pb-hyNUIF9O_ac&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4LhcUIvNs14MVVPRrXorwMBR6zpncDHJC_C_OcBLaITA&oe=6A170F5A"}, "display_name": "Smash Eat Grow", "keywords": ["fun", "multiplayer", "choas", "destroy", "PvP"], "long_description": "**SMASH. EAT. GROW. REPEAT.**\nThe bigger you get, the more you can smash\u2026 but watch out \u2014 there\u2019s always someone hungrier than you!\n\nWELCOME TO **SMASH EAT GROW**\nThe alien Smashers have landed \u2014 bored, reckless, and starving. For them, Earth is an all-you-can-eat buffet.\n\nSmash buildings into pieces, eat the leftovers, and grow into a towering monster. The bigger you get, the more you can destroy \u2014 until another player decides you look tasty for lunch.\n\nIt\u2019s simple: smash to feed, eat to grow, grow to dominate.\n\n**PURE VR CHAOS**\n- Everything\u2019s edible \u2014 cars, buildings, even your friends.\n- Grab whatever you can, hurl it, crush it, or swallow it whole.\n- Every match is a playground of destruction where the last one standing is usually the biggest.\n\nThis is PvP multiplayer madness where laughter and chaos are the only rules.\n\n**CUSTOMISE & COMPETE**\n- Earn BUX for smashing, eating, and winning.\n- Use them to unlock wild outfits, flex your style, and enter tournaments.\n- Every victory feeds your ego \u2014 and your wardrobe.\n\nSmash your fashion. Make yourself appetising.\n\n**BUILT WITH THE COMMUNITY**\nJoin the chaos early and help shape what comes next \u2014 new maps, modes, powers, and more. Player feedback drives the evolution of Smash Eat Grow, one ridiculous update at a time. Discord link: https://discord.gg/gpcPrZUGup\n\n**FEATURES**\n\ud83d\udca5 Fully destructible cities\n\ud83c\udf54 Everything is edible\n\ud83d\udcc8 The bigger you get, the more you can smash\n\ud83c\udfae Chaotic PvP multiplayer\n\ud83d\udcb0 Earn BUX and unlock customisations\n\ud83c\udf0d Built with community feedback\n\n", "short_description": "SMASH. EAT. GROW. REPEAT. The bigger you get, the more you can smash\u2026 but watch out \u2014 there\u2019s always someone hungrier than you! Smash Eat Grow is a chaotic PvP brawler where everything\u2019s edible \u2014 cars, buildings, even your friends. Welcome to Smash Eat Grow, where chaos is the main course."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.xrgames.io/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "XR Games Ltd.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.xrgames.io/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ARCADE", "FIGHTING", "ACTION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "9210243022375860"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1958212698243709"}, {"status